      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“你是十八岁了，但是你是高中生。”",
      "traditional": "“你是十八歲了，但是你是高中生。”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ shì shí bā suì le dàn shì nǐ shì gāo zhōng shēng",
      "english": "“You’re 18 years old, but you’re a high school student.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "妈妈说，“你现在吃饭，八点你去学习。",
      "traditional": "媽媽說，“你現在吃飯，八點你去學習。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shuō nǐ xiàn zài chī fàn bā diǎn nǐ qù xué xí",
      "english": "Mom said, “Now you are eating, and at eight o’clock, you study."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "你学习的时候，你的手机在这儿。你去那儿学习，不要玩手机！”",
      "traditional": "你學習的時候，你的手機在這兒。你去那兒學習，不要玩手機！”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ xué xí de shí hou nǐ de shǒu jī zài zhè‘r nǐ qù nà'r xué xí bú yào wán shǒu jī",
      "english": "When you study, your phone is here. You go study over there, and don’t play with your phone!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "大星说：“我在学校不能玩，回家也不能玩。我什么时候可以玩手机？",
      "traditional": "大星說：“我在學校不能玩，回家也不能玩。我什麼時候可以玩手機？",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng shuō wǒ zài xué xiào bù néng wán huí jiā yě bù néng wán wǒ shén me shí hou kě yǐ wán shǒu jī",
      "english": "Daxing said, “I can’t play at school, and I can’t play at home. When can I play on my phone?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "我十八岁了，我是大人了！”",
      "traditional": "我十八歲了，我是大人了！”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shí bā suì le wǒ shì dà ren le",
      "english": "I’m 18 years old. I’m an adult!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
