      "I’m 18 Years Old",
      "",
      "Daxing’s mom was unhappy, and Daxing was also a little unhappy. ",
      "",
      "“Mom, I’m 18 years old!” said Daxing.",
      "",
      "“You’re 18 years old, but you’re a high school student.”",
      "Mom said, “Now you are eating, and at eight o’clock, you study.",
      "When you study, your phone is here. You go study over there, and don’t play with your phone!”",
      "",
      "Daxing said, “I can’t play at school, and I can’t play at home. When can I play on my phone?",
      "I’m 18 years old. I’m an adult!”",
      "",
      "Mom said, “I’m your mom; you have to listen to me!”",
      "",
      "Daxing was unhappy, and I was also unhappy. I wanted to play with Daxing!",
